Read `.agents/conventions/admin.md` and
`.agents/skills/operator-dashboard/SKILL.md`.

Dependency injection with pydantic settings: `AdminSettings.from_env`,
`ResolverClient` with an injected `fetch`, `Registry` supplied through FastAPI
`Depends`. Templates are an in-package DictLoader with autoescaping and must
stay self-contained: no CDN, no remote asset, it has to work on an isolated
LAN. Admin endpoints live on the resolver's loopback port only, never on the
public health port. Access needs loopback or a trusted proxy carrying
`X-Authentik-Username`. Destructive actions need explicit confirmation and say
what happened. A dead resolver degrades to an error card, never a broken page.
